      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. i'm seeing a bit of both actually. i might go grab some stuff at the garden center this weekend. do you have any recommendations for a specific type of granular fertilizer that's good for the portland soil type, or maybe something that's easy to apply so I don't mess up the ratio?",
